owc.dat     OWC             Original working curve lookup table path
LINEAR      WCType          Working curve formula: LINEAR, QUADRATIC, or EXP
4.20e8      k1              First parameter defining the working curve shape
0.0         k2              Second parameter defining the working curve shape
TRUE        AdaptiveC2      Use adaptive slow spring damping based on a target period; if true, the BA in the Line TYPES section will NOT be used
300.0       CritT           Target period to separate wave-frequency and low-frequency responses from slow responses; used when AdaptiveC2=True
1.0e-5      DampingRatio    The fast spring dampint relative to the slow spring damping, for numerical stability, usually small; used when AdaptiveC2=True